    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "She ____ to school every day.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "go"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "goes"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "going"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "went"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "主语 She 是第三人称单数，在一般现在时中，动词要加 -s 或 -es。go 的第三人称单数形式是 goes。“every day” 表示经常性的动作，用一般现在时。",
    "hint": "一般现在时中，当主语是 he/she/it 时，动词要变什么形式？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
