    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "Tom is ____ than Jack.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "tall"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "taller"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "tallest"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "more tall"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "两者比较用比较级，tall 的比较级是 taller（单音节词加 -er）。“than” 是比较级的标志词。tallest 是最高级，more tall 是错误形式（单音节词不用 more）。",
    "hint": "看到 “than” 就要想到比较级。tall 是单音节词，比较级怎么变？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1603",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 5,
    "grade_max": 6,
