    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "____ I borrow your pen, please?",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "Must"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "Should"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Can"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "Will"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "Can 在这里表示请求许可，“Can I borrow your pen?” 意思是“我可以借你的笔吗？”这是一种礼貌的请求方式。Must 表示“必须”，语气太强，不适合请求。",
    "hint": "向别人借东西时，应该用礼貌的方式请求，哪个词表示“可以”？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 25,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1606",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 5,
    "grade_max": 6,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "短文阅读"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "Read the passage:\n\nMy name is Lily. I get up at 7:00 every morning. I have breakfast at 7:30. Then I go to school by bus. School starts at 8:30. I have lunch at school at 12:00. After school, I usually play with my friends. I go home at 5:00.\n\nHow does Lily go to school?",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "By bike"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "By bus"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "On foot"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "By car"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "短文中写道 “I go to school by bus”（我坐公交车去上学），所以 Lily 是坐公交车上学的。",
    "hint": "仔细阅读短文中关于去上学方式的那句话。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 45,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
